# The guard of board-keeps-drafts.drive, for command/run. tests/drive.rs installs the
# open-tasks example patched to run search.open whenever the tasks change. While a card is
# typed, a task another program writes makes it ask: the search doesn't open, the card stays,
# and when the edit ends the status line says what was not done. With the card saved, the next
# command/run opens the search. tests/drive.rs reads the canvas after.
size 140x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
env COLD_LAVA_TODAY=2026-11-07
wait-for ☐ 16 open tasks
keys w
wait-for whiteboards · type to filter · ⏎ open · Esc back
type Drafts
keys enter
wait-for whiteboard Drafts · 0 cards
keys n
wait-for editing · type text · ⏎ new line · Esc done (saves)
type Draft
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] Sweep the ash off the roof\n
wait-for ☐ 17 open tasks
expect whiteboard Drafts
expect Draft▏
type , kept
wait-for Draft, kept▏
keys esc
wait-for open-tasks wanted to run search.open: not while a card is being edited
expect whiteboard Drafts · 1 cards
screen
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] Sweep the ash off the roof\n- [ ] Count the masks\n
wait-for ☐ 18 open tasks
wait-gone whiteboard Drafts
expect-not open-tasks wanted to run search.open
screen
keys esc
wait-for ? help  q quit
keys q
exits 0
